sequenceDiagram
 participant Participant
 participant API as Next.js API
 participant SQL as MySQL
 Participant->>API: Captain accepts application OR recipient accepts invitation
 API->>SQL: BEGIN
 API->>SQL: Lock track, team, applicant, application
 API->>SQL: Verify captain, pending state, registration
 API->>SQL: INSERT membership
 Note over SQL: Unique user prevents two teams; trigger checks capacity
 API->>SQL: Accept application; close other pending applications
 alt All steps succeed
  API->>SQL: COMMIT
  API-->>Participant: Updated team
 else Permission, capacity, uniqueness or concurrency error
  API->>SQL: ROLLBACK
  API-->>Participant: Explain error / refresh and retry
 end
